{"version": 2, "width": 100, "height": 32, "timestamp": 1792502469, "env": {"TERM": "xterm-ghostty"}}
[0.010188, "o", "\u001b[3J\u001b[H\u001b[2J"]
[0.010317, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.010335, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m  6 \u00b7 Call\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.010349, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u2550\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.012266, "o", "\u001b[2m  recorded run \u00b7 Tue 20 Oct 2026, 15:21 CEST\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.012285, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.014615, "o", "\u001b[35m\ud83d\udde3  Callers see one endpoint that speaks the OpenAI and Anthropic APIs. They name a model, \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[35m    never a cluster.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.017175, "o", "\u001b[35m\ud83d\udde3  Every caller needs an API key; the gateway stamps who called on every request.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.017376, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ kubectl get inferencegateway eu\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.044238, "o", "NAME   CLUSTER             ADDRESS           SYNCED   READY   AGE\r\n"]
[0.044301, "o", "eu     aks-swedencentral   172.160.123.204   True     True    169m\r\n"]
[0.045964, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ kubectl -n ml-team get modelservice qwen-7b\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.072392, "o", "NAME      MODEL             SYNCED   READY   AGE\r\nqwen-7b   ml-team/qwen-7b   True     True    75m\r\n"]
[0.074001, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.102327, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b8 No key, no model\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.129966, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ curl http://172.160.123.204/v1/models\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.23055, "o", "  \u001b[31mHTTP 401\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.230594, "o", "\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b8 With a key\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.261374, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ curl http://172.160.123.204/v1/models \\\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.261436, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m    -H 'Authorization: Bearer sk-\u2026'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.374673, "o", "  ml-team/qwen-7b\r\n"]
[0.374902, "o", "\r\n"]
[0.374943, "m", "ENTER"]
[0.374956, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[33m\u25b8 A chat completion, streamed\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.441608, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m$ curl -N http://172.160.123.204/v1/chat/completions \\\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.44165, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m    -H 'Authorization: Bearer sk-\u2026' \\\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[1m\u001b[36m    -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.441666, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m    -d '{\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.441678, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m      \"model\": \"ml-team/qwen-7b\",\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.441689, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m      \"stream\": true,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.441699, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m      \"max_tokens\": 80,\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.441724, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m      \"messages\": [{\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"In two sentences, what does an inference gateway do?\"}]\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[0.441738, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[36m    }'\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[1.246324, "o", "    An inference gateway acts as an intermediary to receive \r\n    requests for machine learning models, process them, and return \r\n    the model's predictions. It handles the communication between \r\n    the client applications and the model servers, ensuring \r\n"]
[1.246574, "o", "    efficient and secure data exchange."]
[1.246944, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.25531, "o", "\r\n"]
[1.255338, "o", "\u001b[1m\u001b[32m\ud83d\udca1 One OpenAI-compatible endpoint. Callers never see a cluster.\u001b[0m\r\n\r\n"]
